WEBVTT

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:15.450
Spring, 3 years ago

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:15.450
Spring, 3 years ago

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:15.450
Spring, 3 years ago

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:15.450
Spring, 3 years ago

00:00:15.850 --> 00:00:18.310
Sorry to come by so early, Subaru.

00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:18.450
Subaru Mimura

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:20.770
But I wanted to see how you were doing.

00:00:20.770 --> 00:00:22.560
How are you feeling?

00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:24.150
I'm fine.

00:00:24.150 --> 00:00:26.850
I'm going to fix my knee, no matter what!

00:00:26.850 --> 00:00:29.020
Please just wait a year for me.

00:00:29.020 --> 00:00:30.100
We will.

00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:36.350
Oh, yeah. Is there anyone else
you're interested in from my grade?

00:00:36.350 --> 00:00:37.940
Let's see...

00:00:37.940 --> 00:00:41.400
First up, there's Jungo Takasugi
from Nanwa Middle School.

00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:45.650
Then there's Issei Asamatsu,
who's from your school.

00:00:45.650 --> 00:00:48.400
Yuhi Sawatari from Komabiki Middle School.

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:51.230
Ryudai Jinno from Okuetsu Middle School.

00:00:51.230 --> 00:00:53.650
How about Ochi from Matsumotoichi Middle School?

00:00:53.650 --> 00:00:59.350
Ochi? Sorry, doesn't ring a bell.

00:00:59.350 --> 00:01:04.350
Mitsuomi Ochi. He doesn't
stand out much, but he's skilled.

00:01:04.350 --> 00:01:06.770
Oh? I'll keep my eyes out then.

00:01:06.770 --> 00:01:10.190
Ochi from Matsumotoichi Middle School.

00:01:10.190 --> 00:01:12.810
Sounds like you're making
the dream team from Fukui.

00:01:12.810 --> 00:01:16.440
I'm getting excited.

00:01:16.440 --> 00:01:19.270
I'm definitely going to Fukuho!

00:01:20.350 --> 00:01:22.810
<i>We were so scared that we went numb</i>

00:01:22.810 --> 00:01:25.190
<i>And our legs buckled from under us</i>

00:01:25.190 --> 00:01:30.150
<i>We still can't forget the tears</i>
<i>that fell back then even now</i>

