00:02:58.940 --> 00:03:00.100
Nice serve!

00:03:00.100 --> 00:03:02.100
There's no quick! Keep your eye on the left!

00:03:05.440 --> 00:03:06.730
Guess I'm not getting through.

00:03:08.730 --> 00:03:10.150
Subaru, up top!

00:03:15.480 --> 00:03:16.210
Issei!

00:03:16.210 --> 00:03:17.020
Got it!

00:03:20.190 --> 00:03:22.230
Yeah!

00:03:23.810 --> 00:03:25.400
Nice save.

00:03:25.400 --> 00:03:27.810
Man, this is intense.

00:03:27.810 --> 00:03:30.440
You just beat us, remember?

00:03:30.440 --> 00:03:34.520
You don't always have to be
the one to score. It can be anyone.

00:03:34.520 --> 00:03:36.150
It looks like Fukuho this year

00:03:36.150 --> 00:03:38.600
will be going places.

00:03:38.600 --> 00:03:40.560
Right! Thank you very much!

00:03:44.900 --> 00:03:47.060
Next up, we have Seiin's #8.

00:03:47.060 --> 00:03:51.520
When it comes to Haijima, I can't
see what's unique about his setting.

00:03:51.520 --> 00:03:54.650
There's no one direction he's better at...

00:03:54.650 --> 00:03:56.560
Or rather, none that he's bad at.

00:03:56.560 --> 00:03:59.480
He's paying more attention
to how the enemy team is blocking

00:03:59.480 --> 00:04:02.480
rather than how well his team receives the ball.

00:04:02.480 --> 00:04:04.730
He's a troublesome genius.

00:04:04.730 --> 00:04:08.190
Meaning, we're just going to have
to deal with him by keeping an eye out

00:04:08.190 --> 00:04:10.520
in places that're hardest to defend.

00:04:10.520 --> 00:04:14.100
That's actually a lot harder
than you make it sound.

00:04:14.100 --> 00:04:18.770
If you can't deal with Haijima,
we need to go after Kuroba instead.

00:04:18.770 --> 00:04:22.520
If we can deal with the two first years,
Seiin will be the same team as last year.

00:04:22.520 --> 00:04:24.900
There's no way Fukuho
is going to lose to a weak team

00:04:24.900 --> 00:04:26.900
that's lost in the first round each year.

00:04:26.900 --> 00:04:28.650
Well, listen to you!

00:04:28.650 --> 00:04:31.270
You're awesome, Ochi- <i>senpai</i> ! Take me!

00:04:34.440 --> 00:04:35.980
Subaru, Jungo, Issei.

00:04:35.980 --> 00:04:38.770
We're putting all the guys
bigger than Kuroba on the left.

